[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど、大体の状況は分かったわ。\nそれで私たちが集められたってわけね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see, so I understand the general situation. That's why we were all gathered here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本の中の世界なんて面白そうじゃない！\n天才のアタシにふさわしい舞台だわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A world inside a book sounds fascinating! It's the perfect stage for a genius like me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなこと言って、足引っ張んないでよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't go saying stuff like that and then slow us down."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、まぁまぁ、お互い助け合っていこう？\u3000ね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-now, now, let's all help each other out, okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいかい？\u3000ひとまず、ここにいる９人が\n先遣隊として本の中へ入ってもらう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Listen up. For now, the nine of you here will enter the book as an advance team."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もし、しばらくして戻ってこなければ、\n順次援軍を投入していく",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you don't return after a while, we'll send in reinforcements one by one."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は彼の護衛として控えることにしたので\n同行できないが、みんな無茶はしないように",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll be staying behind as his guard, so I can't accompany you. But everyone, don't do anything reckless."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はーい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Okay!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……不安だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm worried."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本の中の世界って、どんな世界かな？\n綺麗なお姫様がいて、お城があったり？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wonder what kind of world it is inside the book? Maybe there's a beautiful princess and a castle?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ということは、アールズのような感じですかね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So it might be something like Arls then?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃ戦うお姫様じゃない……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That wouldn't be a princess who fights though..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっとそこ！\u3000遊びに行くんじゃないんだからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, you over there! We're not going on a pleasure trip, you know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "曲がりなりにも人が行方不明になってる本だしね。\n気を引き締めていこう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It is a book where people have gone missing, after all. We need to stay focused."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そうだね！\u3000頑張ろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "R-right! Let's do our best."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術には錬金術士。きっと解決できるはずだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alchemists have alchemy. I'm sure we can solve this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃ……任せたよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then... I'm counting on you all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるべく早く戻ってこられるようにするわ。\nで、これがその呪われた本？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll try to get back as quickly as possible. So this is the cursed book?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これを開いたら、本の中の世界に……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we open this, we'll be in the world inside the book..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よーし！\u3000みんな、覚悟はいい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All right! Everyone ready?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では、参ります――！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Here we go—!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わわっ！\u3000眩しい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa! So bright!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、何よこれーー！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-what is this?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひゃぁーっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kyaaa!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]